{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891940/extras/00b2d4122a4cd71194f55d054f01c2f3.poster.avif?t=1770368237\" width=550 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891940/extras/00b2d4122a4cd71194f55d054f01c2f3.webm?t=1770368237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891940/extras/00b2d4122a4cd71194f55d054f01c2f3.mp4?t=1770368237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u300eWho's Next?\u300f is an online social deduction tag game for 4 to 10 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate and chase at the same time, survive until the end, and become the ultimate winner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find your soul and identify the one you need to eliminate!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891940/extras/6272a238a4cb9a2f4052a7ee4b5634a5.poster.avif?t=1770368237\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891940/extras/6272a238a4cb9a2f4052a7ee4b5634a5.webm?t=1770368237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891940/extras/6272a238a4cb9a2f4052a7ee4b5634a5.mp4?t=1770368237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All players are connected in a linear tag-like chain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891940/extras/18885ddd96d021343ed7aa43e1caadfe.avif?t=177036823